# Coverage deck: the "whenever … is <Destroy>" watchers.
# EBP04-002 / EBP04-005 Godzilla(2004) as the rank 2 / 4 monsters watch the
# opponent's battle card in their column; rank 1 strategies (EBP04-075,
# EPR-004, EPR-005) meet their conditions. EBP04-039 Zilla watches this
# deck's non-red (white) battle cards on the opponent's turn.
# Opponent: must destroy, crush or overload battle cards — e.g. ESD02 Starter
# (it overloads its own column cards; see hunterdurbin/godzilla-sim-issue-tracker#15).
[monster deck]
1 EBP04-001
1 EBP04-002
1 EBP04-003
1 EBP04-005

[main deck]
3 EBP04-001
3 EBP04-002
3 EBP04-003
3 EBP04-005
4 EBP04-039
2 EBP04-042
4 EBP01-068
4 EBP01-069
4 EBP04-069
4 EBP04-070
4 EBP04-071
4 EBP04-075
4 EPR-004
4 EPR-005
